{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"snakes-and-ladders UI copy.limits","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"snakes-and-ladders.copy.limits","keys":["snakes-and-ladders.copy.limits"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Ang Snakes and Ladders ay nilalaro sa maraming lugar na may iba't ibang board art, jump locations at finish rules. Ginagamit ng pahinang ito ang orihinal na board artwork at nakalista ang mga patakaran ng overshoot nito; huwag itong ituring na tanging lokal o opisyal na bersyon. Ginagamit ng laro ang isang simpleng katunggali ng kompyuter, hindi isang tugma sa network. Walang account ang kailangan at walang mga galaw ang nai-upload.","record_id":"d3b49b74f64cb2acefe959b3bfdd124acf2f17f0b80dbed8ae8938263583ee54","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.726551829000016,"source":"Snakes and Ladders is played in many places with different board art, jump locations and finish rules. This page uses original board artwork and lists its configurable overshoot rule; do not treat it as the only local or official version. The game uses a simple computer opponent, not a network match. No account is needed and no moves are uploaded.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"c0d8596849311b01674cf92f6efbd9c87f1f0113624c734764969d39c87043c3","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Ang Snakes and Ladders ay nilalaro sa maraming lugar na may iba't ibang board art, jump locations at finish rules. Ginagamit ng pahinang ito ang orihinal na board artwork at nakalista ang mga patakaran ng overshoot nito; huwag itong ituring na tanging lokal o opisyal na bersyon. Ginagamit ng laro ang isang simpleng katunggali ng kompyuter, hindi isang tugma sa network. Walang account ang kailangan at walang mga galaw ang nai-upload.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
